  "subject": "a man in his Sha Tin flat at 2 a.m. folding fifty pork dumplings for a friends' bring-a-dish dinner, every one bursting in the pot, so he brings the pot as 'dumpling soup'",
  "caption": "Cantonese Afro house with a South African deep groove. Four-on-the-floor kick with conga and shaker loop; warm round sub bass; plucked marimba riff in short syncopated figures; filtered organ stabs on the offbeat. Rolling percussive mix, dry and close, open low end. Female mezzo, chatty mid register, rhythmic half-sung delivery with short male backing shouts. 122 BPM, A minor. Cheeky, bouncy and clumsy. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no big EDM drop, no rock guitar.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n聽日聚會 個個帶餸\n我話我包 五十隻餃\n超市買咗 兩包皮\n仲有一斤 免治豬肉\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n一塊皮擺喺 手板度\n餡一放 就漏晒\n\n[Chorus]\n餃子爆晒 餃子爆晒\n摺極都係 開口笑\n十隻有九隻 唔肯埋\n仲有一隻 黐實張枱\n\n[Verse]\n上網睇片 師傅好快\n三下兩下 摺出花\n我摺出嚟 好似荷包\n又似一隻 扁咗嘅鞋\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n落鑊一煮 咕嘟咕嘟\n啲餡 全部游出嚟\n\n[Chorus]\n餃子爆晒 餃子爆晒\n成煲變咗 豬肉湯\n皮就皮 肉就肉\n各自各 浮喺上面\n\n[Verse]\n凌晨兩點 冇皮喇\n我望住 嗰煲湯\n加啲蔥 加啲胡椒\n都幾香喎 唔錯喎\n\n[Bridge]\n聽日我話 呢個叫\n餃子湯 自己揀\n\n[Chorus]\n餃子爆晒 餃子爆晒\n大家一人 一大碗\n有人搵到 一塊皮\n佢話好彩 抽中咗\n\n[Chorus]\n餃子爆晒 餃子爆晒\n大家一人 一大碗\n有人搵到 一塊皮\n佢話好彩 抽中咗\n\n[Outro]\n下次聚會 我帶汽水\n唔使摺 唔會爆",
